{"about_the_game":"Sent by the Church to investigate strange cases of possession, explore the universe of Baphomet, where numerous areas await you, such as the Templars' Dungeon, the Village, the Catacombs, and many more! Roam through each location and search every nook and cranny to unveil all the secrets hidden within the game!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/543e272c0f1c91c55fd870cbcad145df.poster.avif?t=1711695119\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/543e272c0f1c91c55fd870cbcad145df.webm?t=1711695119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/543e272c0f1c91c55fd870cbcad145df.mp4?t=1711695119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Exorcise your enemies and collect Latin words that you can pronounce at the Altar to enhance your skills!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/0ab2159062c0241373b01bfccff8d1d2.poster.avif?t=1711695119\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/0ab2159062c0241373b01bfccff8d1d2.webm?t=1711695119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/0ab2159062c0241373b01bfccff8d1d2.mp4?t=1711695119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Baphomet is an action game with combat mechanics. Master the art of the Redeemer to neutralize your adversaries, then bestow your blessing when they are at your feet, helpless before your divine power!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/928b352e685dce8a1cffd90e5a8d065e.poster.avif?t=1711695119\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/928b352e685dce8a1cffd90e5a8d065e.webm?t=1711695119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/928b352e685dce8a1cffd90e5a8d065e.mp4?t=1711695119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Carefully scan your environment; many objects could prove useful in facing your enemies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/fe11572456f48702add5637e2db68fcb.poster.avif?t=1711695119\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/fe11572456f48702add5637e2db68fcb.webm?t=1711695119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/fe11572456f48702add5637e2db68fcb.mp4?t=1711695119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Discover formulas, then utter the final words of your victims to learn new skills<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/41db084306ae5d491cc219fbf7923a31.poster.avif?t=1711695119\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/41db084306ae5d491cc219fbf7923a31.webm?t=1711695119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/41db084306ae5d491cc219fbf7923a31.mp4?t=1711695119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstati